[center][size=2][color=#8DCBEB][b]PHANTOM BLADE ZERO  ◆  NAVIGATION  ◆  1.11.5[/b][/color][/size]
[size=6][b]Quest and Exploration Navigation[/b][/size]
[size=4]任务与探索导航 · Fork[/size]
Map routes and a blue guide for quests, collectibles and bells.
任务、收集物与铃铛导航，在地图看路线，在场景跟随蓝色引导线。

[b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/phantombladezero/mods/994?tab=files]DOWNLOAD / 下载[/url]   ·   [url=https://github.com/EstusFlask/pbz-navigation]GITHUB / 源码[/url]   ·   [url=https://github.com/EstusFlask/pbz-navigation/issues]ISSUES / 反馈与联系[/url][/b][/center]

[quote][center][size=5][color=#E7BD75][b]MAINTAINER WANTED
招募贡献者与接手维护者[/b][/color][/size][/center]
我平时比较忙，也已经通关游戏，对接下来如何优化暂时缺少明确方向，希望找人继续开发或接手维护。[b]有导航 Mod、寻路、Unreal Engine Mod 或类似经验更好。[/b]

I am busy with other commitments, have finished the game, and am unsure where to take the next optimizations. I am looking for someone to continue development or take over maintenance. [b]Experience with navigation mods, pathfinding, Unreal Engine modding or related work would be especially helpful.[/b]

[b]请通过 GitHub Issue 联系[/b]，介绍相关经验，尽量附上[b]仓库或 Mod 链接，以及 Nexus Mods 账号[/b]。双方确认合适后，我会邀请你参与 GitHub 协作，并加入本 Mod 的 contributor 名单。
Please introduce yourself in a GitHub Issue, preferably with [b]repository/mod links and your Nexus account[/b]. Once we agree it is a good fit, I can invite you to collaborate on GitHub and add you as a contributor to this Nexus mod.

[center][size=4][b][url=https://github.com/EstusFlask/pbz-navigation/issues/new?template=maintainer.yml]→ APPLY ON GITHUB / 在 GitHub 联系我[/url][/b][/size][/center][/quote]
[size=2]The repository will be made public by its owner. If the links are unavailable, please check again after publication. Existing permissions remain unchanged.
仓库稍后由本人公开；如链接暂时无法访问，请在公开后查看。源码公开保留现有权限。[/size]

[line]
[size=4][color=#8DCBEB][b]◆ DOWNLOAD / 版本选择[/b][/color][/size]
[list]
[*][b]1.12.0 Release — Full edition / 全图发行版[/b]
Experimental collision-based navigation across 11 worlds.
包含 11 个世界的碰撞重建导航，仍在持续完善。[/*]
[*][b]1.12.0 Lite — Smaller alternative / 小体积版[/b]
Retains all original features and adds compact bell-navigation corridors.
保留全部原有功能，新增精简铃铛路网，可独立安装。[/*]
[/list]
[b]Install one edition at a time. / 只启用一份导航。[/b]
To switch Full ↔ Lite, close the game, uninstall the old navigation in UE Mod Manager, then install the other edition. Keep your settings.
全图版与 Lite 互换时，先退出游戏并在管理器卸载旧导航，再安装另一版，保留配置。

[size=4][color=#8DCBEB][b]◆ INSTALL / 安装与依赖[/b][/color][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/phantombladezero/mods/113][b]PBZModLoader[/b][/url] (tested: 1.0.0), then close the game.
安装 PBZModLoader，然后退出游戏。[/*]
[*]Download one navigation ZIP and [b]extract it first[/b].
下载一个导航包，[b]先解压 ZIP[/b]。[/*]
[*]In [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/phantombladezero/mods/2]UE Mod Manager[/url], import the extracted folder containing [b]both ProjectPBZ and platform[/b]. Enable the navigation files and [b]PBZQuestRouteCompat[/b].
向 UE Mod Manager 导入同时包含 [b]ProjectPBZ 和 platform[/b] 的解压目录，启用导航文件及 PBZQuestRouteCompat。[/*]
[*]Restart the game. For manual installation, merge those two extracted folders into the game root after removing the old navigation copy.
重启游戏。手动安装时，先移出旧导航，再将上述两个文件夹合并到游戏根目录。[/*]
[/list]
[b]Optional integrations / 按需搭配[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Collectibles / 收集物联动：[/b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/phantombladezero/mods/187]Map Tracker Plus 1.0.14[/url] + [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/phantombladezero/mods/5]UE4SS for Phantom Blade Zero[/url].[/*]
[*][b]Navigation settings / 导航设置：[/b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/phantombladezero/mods/149]Mods Menu[/url] (tested: 0.7.2).[/*]
[*][b]Rope colors / 绳子颜色：[/b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/phantombladezero/mods/173]PbzModConfig[/url] + UE4SS. Open / 打开 [b]Mods → Quest & Exploration Navigation → Rope color[/b]. Choose Red, Blue (default) or Custom; changes save automatically. 可选红色、蓝色（默认）或自定义，自动保存。[/*]
[/list]
Loaders and the collector are separate downloads. PBZQuestRouteCompat belongs to navigation; keep [b]PbzMapTracker[/b] files untouched.
包内不含加载器、UE4SS 本体或收集 Mod。PBZQuestRouteCompat 属于导航，不替换 PbzMapTracker 文件。

[size=4][color=#8DCBEB][b]◆ CONTROLS / 基本操作[/b][/color][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Quests / 任务：[/b]Use normal game tracking. 使用游戏原有任务追踪操作。[/*]
[*][b]Mouse / 鼠标：[/b]Left-click a collectible to track it, or hover and middle-click to navigate with its actual floor. Close map filters before middle-clicking blank space to place a pin.
左键追踪收集物，或悬停后中键导航并保留实际楼层。落旗前关闭地图筛选，再中键点击空白处。[/*]
[*][b]Controller / 手柄：[/b]Use the D-pad on the regional map to focus a visible collectible, then press A. Use normal stick selection for native bells.
区域地图中用十字键选择可见收集物，按 A 确认；原生铃铛仍用摇杆选择。[/*]
[*][b]Cancel / 取消：[/b]Hold middle mouse or A on blank map space for about 0.6 seconds.
地图空白处长按中键或 A 约 0.6 秒。[/*]
[*][b]World guide / 场景引导：[/b]Close the map and enable WorldThread. Sense30 mode requires Sense first. Teleporting, climbing, grappling, ladders and lifts remain manual; step onto an automatic slope to slide.
关闭地图并开启 WorldThread；Sense30 模式先使用洞照。传送、攀爬、钩索、梯子和升降装置由玩家操作，自动滑坡踏上即可触发。[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][color=#8DCBEB][b]◆ FEATURES / 导航功能[/b][/color][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Map + world guidance / 地图与场景：[/b]Routes for quests, map pins, collectibles and bells, plus a blue world line raised above the ground.
地图查看路线，关闭地图后跟随离地的蓝色引导线。[/*]
[*][b]Activated-bell transfers / 已激活铃铛中转：[/b]Compares walking with available bell travel. Follow the departure leg, teleport manually, then continue toward the original item.
比较步行与可用铃铛中转，先引导到出发铃铛，手动传送后继续原物品末段。[/*]
[*][b]Checked route segments / 通路检查：[/b]Ground support, character clearance, known locks and recognized mechanism conditions inform guidance. Searches can retain a checked prefix while looking for a detour.
检查地面、身体空间、已知门锁与机关；寻找绕路时可保留已确认的前段。[/*]
[*][b]Collector sync / 收集联动：[/b]Keeps each target's 3D location and floor, follows selection changes and collection, and adds supplementary Chinese acquisition hints without replacing existing detailed descriptions.
保留目标三维位置与楼层，同步切换、收集和取消；补充中文获取提示，保留原有详细说明。[/*]
[*][b]Display / 显示：[/b]Calculation/loading messages, configurable rope colors, and no runtime downloads.
提供计算与加载提示、绳色设置，运行时不联网下载。[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][color=#8DCBEB][b]◆ PLEASE NOTE / 使用须知[/b][/color][/size]
The full edition is experimental. Complex floors, traversal actions, mechanisms and unloaded areas can still produce missing or inaccurate routes. Guidance may stop at an obstacle; follow the actual environment when blocked.
全图版仍为实验版。复杂楼层、特殊动作、机关和未加载区域可能缺路或指引不准确；遇到关闭通路时可能只指到障碍前，请以游戏实际场景为准。

[size=4][color=#8DCBEB][b]◆ HELP / 升级、排错与卸载[/b][/color][/size]
[spoiler]Upgrade, configuration and troubleshooting / 点击展开详细说明

[b]Upgrading / 旧版升级[/b]
Disable the old navigation and keep only one copy. When migrating from the old JS collector, move out the old pbz-map-tracker folder, legacy 0.7.x zzz_PBZQuestRoute_P files and PBZQuestRouteMouse. Do not enable both collector generations.
停用旧导航，只保留一份。由旧 JS 收集版迁移时，移出旧 pbz-map-tracker 目录、0.7.x 的 zzz_PBZQuestRoute_P 文件及 PBZQuestRouteMouse，不要同时启用两代收集 Mod。

Legacy JS-only minimap routes, enlarged icons and automatic-accessory hints have not been ported to the UE4SS collector.
旧 JS 专用的小地图路线、放大图标、自动饰品提示尚未迁移到 UE4SS 收集版。

[b]Configuration / 配置[/b]
Navigation: [b]ProjectPBZ/Content/Paks/~mods/PBZQuestRoute.txt[/b]
Rope color: [b]PBZQuestRoute-settings.json[/b] in the actual ProjectPBZ/Saved folder. 绳色保存在实际 Saved 目录内。
Back up these settings before replacing or uninstalling navigation. 更新与卸载前备份配置。

[b]Compatibility / 兼容说明[/b]
Tested collector: Map Tracker Plus 1.0.14. Tested UE4SS: v4.0.0 (#30afe5ff) Shipping and package 1.0.3 (v3.0.1-1195-g1ceefac8 Shipping). The adapter retains ABI/hash checks; other collector versions need compatible service interfaces.
已测试收集 Mod 1.0.14、UE4SS v4.0.0（#30afe5ff Shipping）及包 1.0.3（1195 Shipping）。适配器保留 ABI／哈希检查，其他版本须符合服务接口。

[b]Report a problem / 报告问题[/b]
Use [url=https://github.com/EstusFlask/pbz-navigation/issues]GitHub Issues[/url] with your mod/dependency versions, area, target, start/end floors, steps and relevant logs. 请附版本、区域、目标、起终点楼层、步骤及相关日志。
Logs / 日志：[b]ProjectPBZ/PBZModLoader/loader.log[/b] · [b]PBZQuestRoute-startup.txt[/b] in the actual Saved folder · [b]PBZQuestRouteCompat-status.txt[/b] in the adapter folder.
Do not upload full saves or private keys. 不要上传完整存档或密钥。

[b]Uninstall / 卸载[/b]
Close the game and remove navigation through the manager. For manual removal, remove only navigation's PBZQuestRoute scripts/assets and PBZQuestRouteCompat adapter. Keep your config, collector and shared runtimes.
退出游戏后用管理器卸载导航。手动卸载只移除导航自有脚本、资源和 PBZQuestRouteCompat，保留配置、收集 Mod 与共享运行时。[/spoiler]

